{{L 1-3}}

Subsystem guidance lives in `.claude/rules/*.md`. Each file has a `paths:` list and Claude Code loads it when you read or edit a matching file. When you review a diff or plan work in a subsystem without opening its files, open the rule file yourself. The index is at the end of this file. `scripts/field_guide.py` drift-checks this file and every rule file.

{{L 5-221}}

{{L 295-295}}

Per-service notes load with their code: `services-genius.md`, `biography.md`, `photos.md`, `apple-canvas.md`, and `timeline.md` for the Living Timeline and its contract.

{{L 317-321}}

{{L 365-382}}

The endpoint list is in `.claude/rules/endpoints.md` (loads with `routes/**` and `feb8.py`); the field guide is the canonical route map.

{{L 420-445}}

Checked 2026-11-03: `oldScripts/` is gone; legacy code lives in `archive/`.

{{L 447-522}}

## Rule index (`.claude/rules/`)

| File | Loads with |
|---|---|
| `timeline.md` | `routes/timeline.py`, `services/timeline/**`, `tests/test_timeline*.py` |
| `services-genius.md` | `services/genius/**` |
| `biography.md` | `services/biography/**` |
| `photos.md` | `services/photos/**` |
| `apple-canvas.md` | `services/apple/**`, `services/canvas/**` |
| `endpoints.md` | `routes/**`, `feb8.py` |

The search-first section that described a `code_search` tool, which is not installed, is in `docs/2026-11-03-claude-md-archive.md`.
